# The user units that come with the terminal set.
#
# Only the timer is enabled. The service it starts has no [Install] section of
# its own precisely so that it cannot be enabled by accident and run at every
# login instead of once a week.
#
# As with luna-desktop, the package also ships a .wants symlink under
# /usr/lib/systemd/user, because a preset only takes effect if somebody runs
# systemctl --user preset-all.
enable luna-tldr-update.timer
